<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 93-2 -- TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 93-2 -- TEA.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 93-2 at tea on the second day of the second test on Friday. Scores: England 156, Zimbabwe 93-2.</p>
</text>
